{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-6238651","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016宝可梦世界大会","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"旧金山宝可梦世界大会第二天，偶遇快龙并观看宝可拳决赛，见证日本选手夺冠。","date":"2016-08-21","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン世界大会 Day 2","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン世界大会 Day 2","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/6238651.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160824012942id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/6238651.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ポケモン","イベント"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":469,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-6238651/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/001-e6babcba6b.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"旧金山宝可梦世界大会第二天，偶遇快龙并观看宝可拳决赛，见证日本选手夺冠。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">旧金山的唐人街</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">据说是全美最大的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所以我们去吃午饭了！</div>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/001-e6babcba6b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/001-e6babcba6b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n在以螃蟹闻名的店里吃炸螃蟹，以及\n正在玩宝可梦GO的森木君\n<br>\n<br>\n螃蟹当然不用说\n其他每一样也都很好吃\n结果吃得太多了\n于是就在唐人街散步，没想到……\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n聚集了一大群人！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/002-f944f2080e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/002-f944f2080e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n没想到！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/003-dd5063ab17.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/003-dd5063ab17.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"609\"></a></figure>真的假的！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n慌忙不停地投高级球（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/004-d7de746acb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/004-d7de746acb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好不容易抓到了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n昵称改成了\n快龙SF！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n因为是旧金山的孩子\n是特别的快龙！\n为了不把它送给博士，就加上了SF！\n↑\n如果是在平时不同的地方\n\n推荐给它加上地点名！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后\n回到酒店参观会场！\n之前一直没去的\n宝可梦中心WCS临时店！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/005-7bea7d1ce2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/005-7bea7d1ce2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好大的皮卡丘，超级可爱！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/006-d02058c7ba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/006-d02058c7ba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n抱起来也好可爱呀！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天\n决出世界第一名的\n宝可拳比赛会场！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/007-4f927a6b42.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/007-4f927a6b42.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大师组的\n决赛是\n怪力对水晶灯火灵\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/008-0e520db28e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/008-0e520db28e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n这技术也太厉害了！\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/009-d0d6732a11.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/009-d0d6732a11.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大师组的\n冠军和亚军\n是两位日本人！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/010-c3e52133ab.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/010-c3e52133ab.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"692\" height=\"524\"></a></figure>\n\nPotetin，世界第一！恭喜！！\n谢谢你们带来精彩的比赛！\n辛苦了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n高级组中\n使用喷火龙的英国选手\nWoomy!Gun！\n恭喜！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n那么\n终于到了明天\n将决出电子游戏和\n卡牌游戏的世界第一名！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n请大家也在直播间里\n为他们加油哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">サンフランシスコの中華街は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">全米1大きいそうで</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ランチを食べに行ってきました！</div>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/001-e6babcba6b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/001-e6babcba6b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\nカニで有名なお店で揚げたカニと\nPokémon GOをプレイしている森木くん\n<br>\n<br>\nカニはもちろん\nどれもこれも美味しくて\n食べ過ぎたので\n中華街を散歩してたら・・\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n人だかりが！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/002-f944f2080e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/002-f944f2080e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\nなんと！！\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/003-dd5063ab17.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/003-dd5063ab17.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"609\"></a></figure>まじか！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n慌てて\nハイパーボール投げまくった（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/004-d7de746acb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/004-d7de746acb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなんとか捕まえられた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nニックネームは\nカイリューSFに！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nサンフランシスコの子なので\n特別なカイリュー！\n博士に送らないようにSF付けた！\n↑\nいつもと違う場所の時は\n\n場所名付けることをオススメします！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nホテルに戻り会場見学！\n行ってなかった\nポケモンセンターWCS 出張所！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/005-7bea7d1ce2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/005-7bea7d1ce2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大きなピカチュウ超かわいい！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/006-d02058c7ba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/006-d02058c7ba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\nだっこしても かわいいよー！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\n<br>\n\n\n本日\n世界1位が決まる\nポッ拳の大会部屋へ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/007-4f927a6b42.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/007-4f927a6b42.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスターカテゴリの\n決勝戦は\nカイリキーvsシャンデラ\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/008-0e520db28e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/008-0e520db28e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nなんという巧さ！\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/009-d0d6732a11.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/009-d0d6732a11.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてマスターカテゴリの\n優勝と準優勝は\n日本人の2人！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/010-c3e52133ab.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6238651/010-c3e52133ab.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"692\" height=\"524\"></a></figure>\n\nポテチン世界1位  おめでとう！！\n素晴らしい試合をありがとう！\nお疲れ様でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nシニアカテゴリでは\nリザードンを使ったイギリスの\nWoomy!Gun選手！ \nおめでとう！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさあ\nいよいよ明日は\nビデオゲームとカードゲームの\n世界1位が決まります！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n皆さんもニコ生で\n応援してくださいね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>"}}